<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY SEPT C/A DEFICIT $38 MLN VS SEPT $99 MLN.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY SEPT C/A DEFICIT $38 MLN VS SEPT $99 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's current account</p>
<p>deficit was $38 million in September, down from a deficit of</p>
<p>$99 million in August, the National Bank of Hungary said in a</p>
<p>statement on Friday</p>
<p>HUNGARY C/A BALANCE (in million dollars)</p>
<p>    SEPT 96     AUG 96    JAN-SEPT 96	 JAN-SEPT 95</p>
<p>	-38	    -99	 -1,104		-2,276</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
</text>
